    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:544a501c412c949eaf775273",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这些仙贝都是比较多裂开的，\n我先当作瑕疵品挑了出来。\n可以麻烦你搬去后场吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "822b90ea2e42879d02a61bc5a7918fa63440fc2c0514f8a0d5148ca10bb1c0f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:629c35783039d43a8d0935ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一边搬着被认定为瑕疵品的商品，\n一边看向第一红宝石调整后的展示架。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9418bcd4df9275ce8eb5e047b319f5ebdd8ca9a5fd7e75e351e0586e1e2527b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f93bf3c881790cf6f2687c39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她所挑选的商品整整齐齐地陈列在架上，\n丝毫没有任何缺漏或瑕疵──\n看起来的确很完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80900a1a3fd831d2f775e411ba93a068327917ebfd129c74b5706f9e68ecb9cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b5bb89fda1a01ae621eda7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅确实考虑到店家的利益，\n老婆婆也很高兴……\n于是我开口称赞了她的体贴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "797af367abe8d5416125582bc9a47c12bca676c26cec862cc99de04d6139d821",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c8f96ead23ab89647f935d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
