    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:544f87e6731e0703b2c5beb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，我并没有那种想法。\n我只是做我应该做的事情而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69bdce7b301921bb07d214ddbe2541cadd3350ba4c485ce77653e30621f8f36e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
